<title>UK: CSFB sets warrants on Hong Kong share basket.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets warrants on Hong Kong share basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it has issued 50,000 American-style call warrants on a basket of Hong Kong shares.</p>
<p>Each basket consists of shares of Citic Pacific, Guangdong Investments, New World Infrastructure, Florens, China Resources Enterprise Ltd, Guangzhou Investment, Bank of East Asia, New World Development and Shangri-La Asia Ltd.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$15,000		 PREMIUM	13.88 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     US$27.0		   GEARING	7.18 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.JAN.97-26.FEB.98   PAYDATE	20.JAN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$15,006		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
